@startuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor User
participant Browser
participant "PlantUML Anywhere" as Ext
participant "@plantuml/core (WASM)" as Core

User -> Browser: open diagram.puml
Browser -> Ext: detect .puml content
Ext -> Core: render(source)
Core --> Ext: SVG
Ext -> Browser: show preview
Browser --> User: diagram rendered

note over Core: Runs fully offline.\nNo server, no upload.
@enduml
